      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Moline%2C_Kansas",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A limestone waterfall on an intermittent stream lies just west of the famous Swinging Bridge, adding a natural landmark to the town.",
